                                "html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\r\n<html lang=\"es\">\r\n<head>\r\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\r\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\r\n  <title>Alerta de Sistema - Handly</title>\r\n  <style>\r\n    body {\r\n      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\r\n      background-color: #0f172a;\r\n      margin: 0;\r\n      padding: 0;\r\n      color: #e2e8f0;\r\n    }\r\n    .container {\r\n      max-width: 620px;\r\n      margin: 30px auto;\r\n      background-color: #1e293b;\r\n      border-radius: 12px;\r\n      overflow: hidden;\r\n      border: 1px solid #334155;\r\n      box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);\r\n    }\r\n    .header {\r\n      background-color: #ef4444;\r\n      padding: 20px 25px;\r\n      color: #ffffff;\r\n      display: flex;\r\n      align-items: center;\r\n    }\r\n    .header h1 {\r\n      margin: 0;\r\n      font-size: 20px;\r\n      font-weight: 700;\r\n      letter-spacing: -0.3px;\r\n    }\r\n    .badge {\r\n      display: inline-block;\r\n      background-color: #b91c1c;\r\n      color: #fef2f2;\r\n      padding: 4px 10px;\r\n      border-radius: 6px;\r\n      font-size: 12px;\r\n      font-weight: 700;\r\n      margin-top: 6px;\r\n      text-transform: uppercase;\r\n    }\r\n    .content {\r\n      padding: 25px;\r\n    }\r\n    .alert-title {\r\n      font-size: 16px;\r\n      font-weight: 600;\r\n      color: #f87171;\r\n      margin-bottom: 12px;\r\n    }\r\n    .message {\r\n      font-size: 14px;\r\n      line-height: 1.6;\r\n      color: #94a3b8;\r\n      margin-bottom: 20px;\r\n    }\r\n    .card {\r\n      background-color: #0f172a;\r\n      border: 1px solid #334155;\r\n      border-radius: 8px;\r\n      padding: 16px;\r\n      margin-bottom: 20px;\r\n    }\r\n    .card-title {\r\n      font-size: 12px;\r\n      text-transform: uppercase;\r\n      color: #64748b;\r\n      font-weight: 700;\r\n      margin-bottom: 10px;\r\n      letter-spacing: 0.5px;\r\n    }\r\n    .data-row {\r\n      padding: 6px 0;\r\n      font-size: 14px;\r\n    }\r\n    .data-label {\r\n      color: #94a3b8;\r\n    }\r\n    .data-value {\r\n      font-weight: 600;\r\n      color: #f8fafc;\r\n      font-family: monospace;\r\n      background-color: #1e293b;\r\n      padding: 2px 6px;\r\n      border-radius: 4px;\r\n    }\r\n    .code-block {\r\n      background-color: #020617;\r\n      border: 1px solid #1e293b;\r\n      border-radius: 8px;\r\n      padding: 14px;\r\n      font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, monospace;\r\n      font-size: 12px;\r\n      color: #38bdf8;\r\n      overflow-x: auto;\r\n      white-space: pre-wrap;\r\n      word-break: break-all;\r\n    }\r\n    .footer {\r\n      background-color: #0f172a;\r\n      padding: 16px 25px;\r\n      text-align: center;\r\n      font-size: 12px;\r\n      color: #64748b;\r\n      border-top: 1px solid #1e293b;\r\n    }\r\n  </style>\r\n</head>\r\n<body>\r\n\r\n  <div class=\"container\">\r\n    <div class=\"header\">\r\n      <div>\r\n        <h1>⚠️ Unhandled Webhook Event</h1>\r\n        <div class=\"badge\">Error de Ruteo / Fallback</div>\r\n      </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"content\">\r\n      <div class=\"alert-title\">Evento no procesado en la automatización</div>\r\n      <div class=\"message\">\r\n        El escenario de Make/n8n recibió una petición webhook con un tipo de evento que no coincide con ninguno de los filtros configurados en el Router.\r\n      </div>\r\n\r\n      <div class=\"card\">\r\n        <div class=\"card-title\">Detalles de la Petición</div>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"data-row\">\r\n          <span class=\"data-label\">Event Type recibido:</span>\r\n          <span class=\"data-value\">{{2.event_type}}</span>\r\n        </div>\r\n        \r\n        <div class=\"data-row\" style=\"margin-top: 6px;\">\r\n          <span class=\"data-label\">Destinatario original:</span>\r\n          <span class=\"data-value\">{{2.recipient_email}}</span>\r\n        </div>\r\n      </div>\r\n\r\n      <div class=\"card-title\">Payload Recibido (Raw JSON)</div>\r\n      <div class=\"code-block\">\r\n{\r\n  \"event_type\": \"{{2.event_type}}\",\r\n  \"recipient_email\": \"{{2.recipient_email}}\",\r\n  \"data\": {{2.data}}\r\n}\r\n      </div>\r\n\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"footer\">\r\n      Alerta automática para Dev/Staff • <strong>Handly Core System</strong>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </div>\r\n\r\n</body>\r\n</html>",
                                "subject": "⚠️ [Handly System Alert] Evento de webhook no reconocido: {{2.event_type}}",
